{
	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "a274f6d78c48528e",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "wiki-sync (skill): any document into the wiki",
			"x": -60,
			"y": -190,
			"width": 5000,
			"height": 890,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "7f2c3f8a20ddd810",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-sync**\nthe ids given, or `vault` pending",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "a87b55ef4880be14",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Order: sources, receipts, specs. At most ~10 documents or 40 chunks per change",
			"x": 360,
			"y": -10,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0d6777ee0126d1f4",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**source** chunks, per document",
			"x": 740,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "118e4f4e6748ed41",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "One small chunk?",
			"x": 1080,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 200,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "1da35ebce7bfa2f1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Extract it yourself",
			"x": 1380,
			"y": -120,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "c927d81014280b16",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-extract** \u00d7N\none per chunk, waves of 8\n(each calls **source** read)",
			"x": 1380,
			"y": 60,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "903d48cc9ba049de",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Each Item Map complete? Send a partial chunk again, narrower",
			"x": 1740,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "681e137e2741accd",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**match** with every Item Map at once",
			"x": 2120,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 240,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "92f82d4f2887b497",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Slice: subjects that touch one page go together; \u2264 8 per slice",
			"x": 2460,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "94b330cfe8a5aab0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**wiki-draft** \u00d7N\none per slice\n(or yourself, for one or two)",
			"x": 2840,
			"y": 10,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "2a9d7ca4dc87a5dc",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "Assemble the Wiki Change Plan: the drafted writes, a modify of each source page, `absorbs`, the summary with skipped subjects",
			"x": 3200,
			"y": -10,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 140,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "4130976e06392d79",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**change** propose",
			"x": 3620,
			"y": 20,
			"width": 220,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "99f4a445b8c58c02",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "No writes?",
			"x": 3940,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 180,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "0a93adb96a8fdfef",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**change** apply at once; say so in one line",
			"x": 4220,
			"y": -130,
			"width": 260,
			"height": 80,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "3db843f5f18fefc8",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**The user** reads the preview, or the change document in Obsidian, and may edit it",
			"x": 4220,
			"y": 50,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 110,
			"color": "2"
		},
		{
			"id": "df9e95fc6923ac56",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**change** apply: one commit; the documents are no longer pending",
			"x": 4600,
			"y": 30,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 100,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "151826ed42d1e0e9",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**change** reject, with the reason",
			"x": 4600,
			"y": 220,
			"width": 280,
			"height": 60,
			"color": "5"
		},
		{
			"id": "73297675db659a11",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "docs/design/Entities/Text Blob.md",
			"x": 1380,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "051ab4588b968d6c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "docs/design/Entities/Item Map.md",
			"x": 1780,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "8ec968de71dc022c",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "docs/design/Entities/Match Map.md",
			"x": 2440,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "cc0562aab840dc13",
			"type": "file",
			"file": "docs/design/Entities/Wiki Change Plan.md",
			"x": 3180,
			"y": 340,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 300,
			"color": "6"
		},
		{
			"id": "f309802b79b96042",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Entry points**\n- wiki-ingest: captured sources\n- repo-ingest: a repository snapshot\n- thread-receipt: a spec and a receipt\n- the user: \"sync the wiki\"",
			"x": -20,
			"y": -440,
			"width": 320,
			"height": 180,
			"color": "3"
		},
		{
			"id": "b8f20d75f05a3f67",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**Legend**\n\n- cyan: tool (code)\n- yellow: skill or agent (model)\n- purple: document or entity\n- green: hook (code, automatic)\n- orange: the user\n- red: a gate or a refusal",
			"x": -420,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 300,
			"height": 260
		}
	],
